- `apps/backend/lib/runtime_state.ml`: added `workspace_repository_name` to Runtime State JSON.
- `apps/backend/lib/orchestrator.ml`: populates it from `tracker.repo`, falling back to the Workspace Repository root basename.
- `apps/frontend/src/Main.res`: renders the repository name before `Generated ...` in the dashboard header.
- `apps/frontend/src/Pages/Dashboard.res`: added the snapshot field.
- `apps/backend/test/test_backend.ml`: added coverage for the new JSON field.

